From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 03:33:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 235/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add priority cascades for
 overlapping bakes.

Compose overlapping bakes in ascending priority and use entity GUIDs as a
stable tie-breaker. Restore and rebuild the complete overlap set so removing
or moving a plate cannot leave another plate in its captured baseline.
---
